1790372199734915	bones-yzou15	itc:v3:AWLJPM5OcyTJJJEAAAAAQdXt13atVUAAAAEzGA		item.comment	bn-t694	{"body":"Fixed in workspace bn-2fux: compare = (wall_ts, agent_id, event_hash), ITC step removed. Chose option 2 because a pairwise compare must be total for ANY inputs, including legacy skewed logs, so a write-time HLC clamp cannot replace it. A write-time clamp (wall_ts > item's max seen) is still worth adding so causal order implies wall order for new writes: follow-up bone."}	blake3:QDzfeV5CresVybLP_JD6mWlydiPw3iZESkdHEQ4D8_s
