1790375533039466	bones-imvgpj	itc:v3:AWLzPOTyZPOcQAAAAAAAQfb3XrXu4AAAAAEsCQ		item.comment	bn-12ta	{"body":"All 8 Kani harnesses pass. Solver times: varint round-trip 2.8s, canonical decode 3.8s, zigzag 0.02s, timestamp round-trip 7.7s, timestamp decode 98s, rle u8/u16/u32 9/24/62s. Before the fix: canonical decode FAILED and timestamp decode FAILED (add overflow). Mutations: reverting wrapping_sub fails timestamp_codec_round_trips; dropping the last RLE run fails rle_encode_u8_is_lossless. Event type codec: Kani exceeded 12GB and 600s, replaced by an exhaustive unit test (16,105 sequences) and a decode proptest. Review cr-2twh03."}	blake3:jnWEjh2ObbfvXEhjrlxbjvwMO6G4JdLLUMLTHD_dIzI
1790375533071977	bones-imvgpj	itc:v3:AWLzPOTyZPOcQAAAAAAAQfb3XrXu4AAAAAEsCg		item.comment	bn-16g3	{"body":"Fixed in workspace bn-12ta (a550f094): 10th byte > 1 and overlong encodings are rejected. Kani varint_decode_accepts_only_canonical proves every accepted input of up to 11 bytes is canonical. Review cr-2twh03."}	blake3:Kts13ouQN5xCy59KNJI-WN2nk90qqeeaiiDRaDduRxw
