1790376123681251	bones-imvgpj	itc:v3:AWLzPOTyZPOcQAAAAAAAQfb3XrXu4AAAAAEsDQ		item.create	bn-3ht9	{"description":"Found by review of cr-2twh03. crates/bones-core/src/clock/text.rs:227 decode_varint_u64 (ITC text format) accepts overlong LEB128 encodings, and at shift 63 silently drops high bits (checked_shl checks only the shift amount). Same defect class as bn-16g3 in cache/codec.rs. Fix the same way, and add a Kani canonical-decode harness like cache::codec::kani_proofs::varint_decode_accepts_only_canonical (register the file in scripts/kani.sh FILES).","kind":"bug","labels":["verification"],"parent":"bn-274e","size":"xs","title":"clock/text.rs decode_varint_u64 accepts overlong encodings and drops high bits"}	blake3:ZWHvw2yRDyLt53mR-ENk6IFf_AWE9SEbqQjpuwOuuzY
