1790385222825729	bones-imvgpj	itc:v3:AWLzPOTyZPOcQAAAAAAAQfb3XrXu4AAAAAEsMQ		item.comment	bn-52i6	{"body":"Merged. Remaining known gaps (non-blocking, from review): observe_timestamp and next_timestamp are not serialized by ShardLock, so an interleave can lose an increment (duplicate timestamps; harmless, agent/hash break ties). TUI actions open the projection raw, but TUI refresh goes through ensure_projection."}	blake3:T7Z8suKJ2m_Lun2URtd0kruC2EwxMXslJ9cXsp0hNIQ
