1790392048122887	bones-imvgpj	itc:v3:AWLzPOTyZPOcQAAAAAAAQfb3XrXu4AAAAAEsTg		item.create	bn-1dy8	{"description":"ITC no longer affects any decision. bn-t694 took it out of LWW ordering (it made the order non-transitive), bn-52i6 replaced its intent with the HLC receive rule, and no production code ever called join, so stamps from different agents were always concurrent. Remaining cost: a stamp per event, a .bones/itc/agents/<agent>.itc write per event, and Stamp in every LWW register and snapshot.\nPlan: (1) stop generating stamps: new events carry the constant itc:AQ, delete itc_state.rs. (2) remove Stamp from LwwRegister, WorkItemState and SnapshotPayload (old snapshots must still deserialize), delete clock::itc/ops/text, their tests and the text Kani harnesses. The itc field stays in the event format so old lines parse and hashes verify.","kind":"task","labels":["verification"],"parent":"bn-274e","size":"m","title":"Remove interval tree clocks"}	blake3:vw9vv7xMFfD3b5mzdCSlUWfDeVELS34wrkBKremeyHM
