1790392845373491	bones-imvgpj	itc:v3:AWLzPOTyZPOcQAAAAAAAQfb3XrXu4AAAAAEsUg		item.create	bn-36n3	{"description":"Found by projection_order proptest (intermittent). project_redact upserts event_redactions keyed by target hash and keeps the lowest (redacted_at, redacted_by, reason). Two redact events on different items with the same agent, timestamp and reason tie, and item_id is whatever was applied last. Fix: add item_id to the comparison tuple.","kind":"bug","labels":["verification"],"parent":"bn-274e","size":"xs","title":"Redaction row depends on order when two redactions tie"}	blake3:faWyRTsO6huBbffAWMOX1g0sZqsfRztGKWSLMiif5e4
