1790466610585991	bones-imvgpj	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-39tj	{"description":"Found in bn-18fs. rebuild.rs runs the replay with journal_mode=OFF, so SAVEPOINT rollback in project_event/project_batch is undefined: an event that errors during a full rebuild can leave some of its field claims and writes behind, while incremental apply rolls them back. Rebuild and incremental can then differ after any projection error. Fix: keep the rollback journal (or use MEMORY journal) during rebuild, or wrap each event so a failure is fully undone; measure rebuild time (Tier M full_rebuild p50 was 0.99s) before and after.","kind":"bug","labels":["verification"],"parent":"bn-274e","size":"s","title":"Full rebuild runs with journal_mode=OFF, so a failing event can leave partial writes"}	blake3:UCG33hVSR8D2TEgUcGily-VXSHIwhwaGsjRHVtwwFmM
1790468229873830	bones-imvgpj	itc:AQ		item.move	bn-18fs	{"state":"done"}	blake3:sK3hh3kOzbLwinUQwE6J_MktjLNSiucDt_ohjshTV2A
1790468231816683	bones-imvgpj	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-39tj	{"body":"Fixed in bn-18fs (1f91a6e5): rebuild uses journal_mode=MEMORY and project_batch retries with per-event savepoints on failure; file-backed test covers it. Rebuild p50 1.07-1.09s vs 0.99-1.05s."}	blake3:pdy0U7dBEm5y_M19IGNg96M9P8UUE2MUNMRmOPuaGTk
