1790468315967190	bones-imvgpj	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-1npc	{"description":"Known, documented, not order bugs:\n1. Unknown kind/urgency/size strings from newer clients: projection stores raw text, WorkItemState cannot hold it.\n2. A compacted log does not restore comment bodies (snapshot keeps hashes only).\n3. Links to self or to non-ID targets: WorkItemState keeps them, projection claims but writes no row. Generators do not produce these.\n4. A member containing NUL passes is_blank_member but fails the SQLite length() CHECK (foreign writers only; rollback keeps rebuild and incremental equal).\n5. Snapshot state and set members use lower-bound keys (no exact key in the payload); a label re-added only by a snapshot cannot be redacted via its original event hash.","kind":"task","labels":["verification"],"parent":"bn-274e","size":"s","title":"Remaining snapshot/projection gaps after bn-t37g and bn-18fs"}	blake3:9qVjCJlvGct9x8v3Ph3qe8_5nWsGxwqGhnDXeZBYDZk
