1790474996090361	bones-imvgpj	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-qse5	{"description":"CI has failed on every main push since 2026-07 (v0.25.0 and v0.26.0 included). (1) --all-features builds define the global allocator ALLOC more than once (error E0428): mimalloc/jemalloc/dhat-heap features are not mutually exclusive under --all-features. (2) cmd::triage_support::tests::project_root_is_derived_from_projection_path fails on one platform (triage_support.rs:1015). Also failing: Windows default test/clippy jobs. just check does not run --all-features, so these are invisible locally.","kind":"bug","size":"s","title":"CI fails on main since July: --all-features ALLOC clash and triage_support test"}	blake3:XVmmTrC-TicQpjHGYd0_uf34sb3ZORgdUBh-1iJR3UM
1790474996232469	bones-imvgpj	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-1513	{"description":"v0.26.0: the CI CARGO_REGISTRY_TOKEN may update existing crates but not create new ones, so bones-verified got 403 and the loop stopped after bones-sqlite-vec was published; the rest were published by hand with the publish-new key. Fix: (1) skip a crate whose version is already on crates.io (cargo search / sparse index check) so a rerun resumes; (2) document that a new crate must be published once by hand, or scope the CI token for publish-new.","kind":"bug","size":"xs","title":"Release workflow cannot publish new crates or resume a partial publish"}	blake3:L0ao0NtNVTmvypmEZv273-sxgT073mOL6Q48KKsKapE
1790474996271048	bones-imvgpj	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-rm7w	{"body":"Released v0.26.0. CI token got 403 on the new crate bones-verified after bones-sqlite-vec published; published bones-verified, bones-core, bones-triage, bones-search, bones-sim, bones-cli by hand (key from pass, never printed). GitHub release created from the workflow's artifacts (checksums verified) with the CHANGELOG notes. Follow-ups: bn-qse5 (CI), bn-1513 (workflow)."}	blake3:5IqyMsB_fnveOmwcqPDEmAcdcqRAEiT92t0GHgh3-zA
